<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 OTESA - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupwu Ungwu Kwonze Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba OTESALONIKA.</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Otesaloniya</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Otesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupwu Kwonze Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba</para>
  <para style="mt1">OTESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Otesalonika gba akwu kwuse ungweka iyi ɛzhi iyi Oromu mu Omasedoniya le. Ɔpɔlu a bɔ ɔshɔshi mɔmo kwuyengwu a lafya laa Ofilipi. I to kwuye mo akwɛyi Azhu umba bɔkɔ o wo rise ingyi Ɔpɔlu kwuwongu anu itama iyi ilɔ iyi Okrasi iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a ta laa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo bɔkɔ o mbwalu Zhudayizi, o wa laa ovyo laa Ɔpɔlu. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, akwu megaa Ɔpɔlu a lafya laa Otesalonika akwɛyi a ka mu Ɔbɛriya. Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a pwa eza iyi kiya ingyi ki yi mu iwomo mu ɔshɔshi uwu Otesalonika mbaa Otimoti, umɛza wu uwu ɛduma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu ungwu kwonze ungwu Ɔpɔlu a ka laa enzu umba Otesalonika kwɔlɛ o ka ngwu kaa lo kɔ Wambwalu mɔmo ɛnwu ma. A mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu eza iyi a pwa meka iyi ikwidufulo mbala idɛnyi mba; e lolo mbo iyi luzɛ undu a zɛ kwuyengwu e yi mbala mba awu, akwɛyi a gba opwu meka iyi eyo iyi wambwalu mu ɔshɔshi awu o yo meka iyi igbama iyi Okrasi tee: Umbwalu uwu e kpomo dɛ gba Okrasi a gbama le, a fya kwunyɔ ungwepo ungwu bɔkɔ igbama wu i bi shi? Kwuye ungwuna bɔkɔ Okrasi a ba gbama? Ɔpɔlu ba a za mba tee lo so wu mu ɛduma iwomo mbala eyifulomo nzhii ba kwuyengwu Okrasi a ba gbama.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iduma mbala ɛnyigbɛlɛma (1.2 - 3.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛzɔ meka iyi luzɛ undu Umbwalu Okrasi (4.1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okpa meka iyi Inyɔma</para>
  <para style="io1">iyi Okrasi (4.13 - 5.11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛzɔ iyi imbwambwa (5.12 - 22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi Iso (5.23 - 28)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu, mbala Osalasi mbala Otimoti gba ki ka yi kwupu kwɔlɛ le,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Lunyi enzu umba ɔshɔshi uwu Otesalonika, umba bɔkɔ lu kwu enzu umba Ukpo Ete nzu mbala Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Esheshi mbala oloto li yi mbala yi.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luzɛ Mbala Ikwidufulo Iyi Wambwalu Umba Otesalonika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Kinzu ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwo yi lɛɛbi iyɔkpɔɔ, ki koko ki lolo yi kwuyengwunanguna bɔkɔ ki lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ lu wo kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo yi, mbala idɛnyi iyi lu yi yi, mbala idu iyi lu yi yi kwuwongu lu yi eyifulomo mu Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi iyi bɔkɔ i shi lu rima ngiri awu, i shi ki lolo yi iyɔkpɔɔ mu idu iyi Ukpo nzu mbala Ete nzu. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, kinzu ki yitu te Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi yi gba a ŋa yi te la lu kwu umba wu le. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Moo ki ka yi la Iso Iyi esheshi ɛlɛ mu iso iyi kenzu bi mo, i kyo mbala ɛkpasu, mbala Kwundu uwu Ukpo, mbala inyama yi la egbo ikpɛnyi te inyi gba akwu ongbulolo le. Lunyi lu yitu iyi iŋɔma iyi ki ŋɔ mbala yi; akwu kaka kaa li mbwa yi ma le. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Lunyi lu mondo nzu mbala Ɔkwu; lu ma inyashi gyɔɔ, tetete lu na rɛnu ingyi Ukpo ma la ɔnyɛ uwu bɔkɔ ee ngyi mbaa Kwundu uwu Ukpo awu. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ɛlɛ gba i shi Wa mbwalu lɛɛbi mu ese iyi Omasedoniya mbala Akaya o vɔngɔ luzɛ yi le. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Moo iso iyi Ɔkwu ɛlɛ iyi lu ta anu yi ele i fulama munamuna mu ese iyi Omasedoniya mbala Akaya, akwu ɛlɛ kɛɛkyi mo, ɛza iyayi iyi ikwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo i fulama munamuna tete. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ki yi iso iyi isomo ma yi fo. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Moo enzu mbamba mafyimba o so uwewe ewo iyi lu na nzu kwuyengwu ki ka mbaa yi awu, o kyo ɔ zɔ te lu lafya la eshi ibyima lu mbwalu Ukpo, kaa la lu gbo ɔya laa Ukpo ongbulolo ureyi ŋa, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />kaa la lu rigbo igbama iyi Umɛ wu moshi, Umɛ wu Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu Ukpo e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ, uwu a wanzu ma mu amba umba Ukpo umba o yi mu inyɔma awu.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="ms">Ɛduma Iyi Ɔpɔlu E Wo Mu Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ɛmɛ umba ɛnɛ mi, lunyi lu yitu tee ibomo nzu mbaa yi akwu shaa mo.<verse eid="1TH 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Lunyi lu yitu iyi inyashi iyi ki ma mbala ari iyi o kpanzu mu Ofilipayi dɛ ishi ki bi ka mbaa yi mu Otesalonika le. Enzu o towo nzu mo gyɔɔ, tetete Ukpo a ka nzu ɛnwu ma kaa la ki so yi Iso Iyesheshi ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ i ngyi munyi wu awu. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Moo ɛshɛku iyi ki kpa yi ele i ngyi meka iyi iŋama nana egbo iyira nana ki gyi tee la ki kyoro yi mo le mo. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Kinzu ba ki so iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi tee la ki so iyɔkpɔɔ, moo uwu a nyama la nzu akwɛyi e to Ilɔ Iyesheshi ɛlɛ e shi nzu.Kinzu ki wo ɛlɛ kaa la ki she laa Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a pwa egbo nzu ma awu, moo akwu enzu gba ki gyi tee la ki she mbo le mo. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Lunyi lu yitu tee kinzu bo munyi yi laa iso iyi inyima kaa la ki fya kiya munyi yi le mo, nana ki kpo yi ewo meyi kaa la ki nvye ekweyi nzu ma mo, Ukpo gba akwu u uzɔgɔ nzu le! <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Kinzu ki gagyi ipwɔma mbaa onzu uwunawuna mo, munyi yi nana mbaa enzu mbawa mo, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />moo tabɔkɔ ki kwu wa zɛ ilɔ umba Okrasi le, ki yi ɛkpasu iyi ki gagyi kiya mu munyi yi. Kinzu ba ki yi kyo kwuyengwu ki yi mbala yi awu, mate ɛnɛ a bɔ eyi mbaa umɛ wu tayi. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Kinzu ki pwu idɛnyi yi gyɔɔ, inyi gba i shi ki mwɔnyɛ tee la ki shi yi Ilɔ Iyesheshi iyi i ngyi mbaa Ukpo le. Akwu ɛlɛ kɛɛkyi mo, ki kyo kwunyɔ nzu tete kwuwongu lunyi lu yi mu egbo nzu gyɔɔ! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ɛmɛ umba ɛnɛ mi, lu lolo ɛduma iyi ki wo mbala inyashi iyi ki ma kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki ye yi mu Ilɔ Iyesheshi iyi Ukpo izɛma awu! Kinzu ki wo ɛduma lutu lɔnu kaka kaa la ki fulo ɔnzɛnzɛnyi te ewulo mo.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Lunyi lu kwu azɔgɔ, Ukpo tete akwu u uzɔgɔ tee luzɛ undu ki zɛ mekeka yi lunyi wambalu lɛɛbi akwu luzɛ undu ɔsɛsɛ mbala ongbulolo ɔsɛkɛnɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Lunyi lu yitu tee ki wo mbala yi kɛnyikɛnyi kyamate ada e wo mbala ɛmɛ wu tayi. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Ki ka yi ɛnwu ma, ki so yi iso iyi idu igbomo, ba ki so yi iso ngiri tee, la lu zɛ luzɛ marimari undu bɔkɔ lu she laa Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ya yi ma kaa la lu yi ogbo mu Irɛsu wu mbala inzumbɛku wu awu.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi iyɔkpɔɔ, moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki ka yi laa ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi Ukpo awu, lu na yi tee akwu iso iyi Ukpo, moo akwiyi onzu mo. Moo Ukpo e yi mu ɛduma iwomo ma yi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu idu lu fulo. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Ɛmɛ umba ɛnɛ mi, lunyi lu ma la Ɛshɔshi iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ iyi mu Ozhudiya, so mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi. Lunyi lu ma inyashi kyamate Azhu ɛmanyi yi umba o lo mbo tayi, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Enzu mbamba ɔ ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala Anukenzu umba Ukpo ma akwɛyi o ra nzu renya. O she la Ukpo mo ba o wo enzu lɛɛbi ira <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />o wo te kaa la ki lafya la iso isomo la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo kwuwongu kaa lo sa mba ma mo. Mu iwomo mbo ɛlɛ, ingbomo mbo ikyomo gyɔɔ akwɛyi amba umba Ukpo o kpo mamba.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Gyi Kpɔɔ Te La Gba Le So Mu Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ɛmɛmbɛnɛ mi kwuye bwɛ ungwu bɔkɔ o ka nzu ma mbala yi, egbo nzu ba i yi mbala yi. Kwongwu ki gyi te la ki ma yi, akwɛyi ki wo ekpasu gyɔɔ te la ki gba la ki bo munyi yi. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ki gyi te la ki bo munyi yi. Imi Ɔpɔlu mi wo ba mi wo, onzu uwoyi ba ese nzu ɔgwuzɛ ma. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Kimbe bɔkɔ akwu eyifulomo nzu, ɔnyɛ nzu, naa ɛnuma nzu iyi bɔkɔ oo shi nzu inzumbɛku midu iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ a gbama? A kwu lunyi mo re? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Lunyi gba lu kwu ɛnwu ikwumo nzu mbala ɔnyɛ nzu le.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ikama nzu mbala yi akwɛyi ki mate i shi woshi gba o lunzu afyima mu Atɛsi kɛɛkyi nzu. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Akwɛyi ki lɔ Umanyi nzu Otimoti uwu ki wo ɛduma iyi anu itama iyi Ukpo iyi Okrasi kyaa awu te la kɔ yi ɛnwu ma kaa la lu rima gbagiri mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />kaa uwewe la gba kembo mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma kwuwongu inyashi iyi lu yi mu imama le mo. Lunyi mafyi yi lu yitu te akwu igyima iyi Ukpo te la ki ma inyashi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Mo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki yi mbala yi awu, ki za yi keyi dɛ te enzu o lo nzu inyashi, ba tegba i wɔ le yɛriri mate bɔkɔ lu yitu awu. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, bɔkɔ mi fa la idu iyimo akwɛyi mi lɔ Otimoti mbaa yi kaa la mi yitu iyi idukwufulo yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi. Mo kinzu ki wiyi te, ingboshimo onzu uwoyi ele e kyoro yi mo akwɛyi lu lafya la Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma-a, akwɛyi ba ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ ki wo meka yi ele akwiyi umbwa.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otimoti E Bo La Ɛlɔgbulɔ Iyi Bɔkɔ I Kɔ Enzu Ɛnwu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Otimoti uwu a ka munyi yi awu, kekelele ba a gbama a ka nzu la ilɔ iyesheshi te lu degbo lu ra la Ɔzhizɔsi mu akɔ yi. A za nzu kpɔ te lu koko lu lolo mbaa nzu la ɔnyɛ ba lu fa te ɔnuna lu ma nzu, kyamate bɔkɔ kinzu tete ki fa te ɔnuna ki ma yi awu. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ɛmɛnɛ mi, mu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ enzu o ye nzu mu ilomo le, iso ɛlɛ i ka nzu ɛnwu ma kwuwongu ki pwa te lu degbo mu idu i fulomo mu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Kekelele egbo nzu i yi mɛzhi ee la ɔnyɛ kwuwongu ki yitu te lu rima gbagiri mu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Kwuye ungwu ki lɛ Ukpo, ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi gyɔɔ kwuwongu lu shi egbo nzu i yi ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Utu la ɔnu kii lɛ Ukpo iyɛkɔkɔ kaa le shi nzu kaa la ki ma yi, kaa la ki zɔ yi ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ ishoshi te la lu yitu yi kaa idu kwu fulo yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi li kɔma li kyo. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ki lɛ Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ akwu ete nzu awu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Ɔkwu nzu te lɛ wo ɔgwuzɛ kaa la ki gba la ki bo mbaa yi. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Ki lɛ Ukpo Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi te le shi igyi esu iya yi mbala uwewe li kyomo gyɔɔ kyamate bɔkɔ igyima iya yi mu akɔ nzu i yi awu. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Kii lɛ Ukpo te la kɔ yi egbo ma mu Ɔzhizɔsi kaa Ukpo ete nzu le yi yi ombu mo ɔnuwu ombu izɔma akwɛyi a mu ɔnyɛ mbala yi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ba gbama mbala enzu wu umba Ɔkɛrikɛri.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Luzɛ Undu Bɔkɔ Lu Shelaa Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Mu imbwama yi, ɛmɛnɛ mi lunyi la lu vɔngɔ mba nzu luzɛ undu lu zɛ kaa la lu she la Ukpo. Inyi gba akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ lu yi ma wu awu. Kekelele ki kpayi ɛshɛku mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi kaa la lu wo iyi bɔkɔ ika tayi ma. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Kwuwongwu lunyi lu yitu te ɛzɔ iyi ki zɔ yi awu akwu mu idomo iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Ukpo a gyite kaa la lu yi kɛrikɛri: La lu lafya la iyama. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />onzonzu le gbo ɛnwu wu baa ekweyi iyi iyama, la lu wuluma kɛrikɛri kaa enzu lo ma te lu kwu enzu umba esheshi. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Lunyi la lu wo kwupapa iyi iyama mo kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ukpo mo, <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />meka iyi iso ɛlɛ gba Ukpo a gyite onzu uwunawuna le ngbomo la umanyi wu mo le. Onzu uwunawuna ba le ri utu uwu umanyi wu mo. Ki so yi dɛɛ, ki gba ki so yi kpɔ te, enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛnyi tayi o ma kwuwo ungwu Ukpo. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Moo Ukpo a ya nzu ma te la ki kwu enzu wasɛsɛ, la ki kwu enzu umba ingbomo mo. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ onzu uwunawuna uwu e towo ɛzɔ ɛlɛ ma, akwu onzu gba e towo wu mo le mo, Ukpo gba e towo wu mo le. Moo Ukpo gba e shi yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo le.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Mekeka iyi idɛnyi ipwumo iyi esu, o zɔ yi izɔma shaa fo, moo Ukpo a zɔ yi-a te la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi esu. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ongbulolo gba e yi te lu yi mu idɛnyi ɛlɛ izɔma la ɛmanyi yi wa mbwalu mu ɛzhi iyi Omasedoniya. Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, ki kpayi ɛshɛku kaa la lu wo iyi bɔkɔ i ka tayi ma.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Onzu uwunawuna la kyakpɔ kaa la ŋɔma iyi oloto mbala enzu, onzonzu la bɔ eyi mu ɛduma iyi ewo wu kyamate bɔkɔ ki so yi tayi. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Gba lu wo ɛlɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ukpo mo awu o lo yi mo, akwɛyi lunyi ba lu fulo eyi mu kiya ingyi onzu fo.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igbama Iyi Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, ki gyite kaa la lu yi ongbulolo uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o awu, kaa la lu wo ubugyi kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi eyifulomo mo o wo tayi. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ki kwu idu ki fulo te, Ɔzhizɔsi e kpomo akwɛyi Ukpo a gba wu la iyimo mu kwuvɔ, tatayi gba enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo mɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, Ukpo a gba mba la iyimo akwɛyi o re moshi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki degbo la reyi le, ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu Ukpo a ba gbama awu, ki to keyi la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo o awu mo. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Moo Ɔkwu nzu Okrasi mafyi wu aa wɔ moshi a nyɔ la anu itama mu opwu uwɔkwu, akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwakɔ a kpa kwongangaraki akwɛyi wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o awu o da la iyimo keyi. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki degbo lakwunyɔ bɔkɔ ki shimo, Ukpo akwu nzu ma ki bi kpolo esu mbala mba moshi. Tayi gba ki yi mbala Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi le iyɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Kwuwo kwɔngu la lu ka esu ɛnwu ma mu iso ɛlɛ.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Yi Ɛnwu ma Iyi Inyɔma Iyi Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, iso iyi kwuye mbala afyi iyi igbama iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, i fa te lɔ zɔ yi izɔma fo, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />moo lunyi lu yitu sɛsɛsɛ te igbama iyi Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ i ŋii yi kyamate uwɛlɔ bɔkɔ e fye mogba uwu onzu mutu tayi. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Kwuye kwɔngu enzu o ma badaa akwɛyi o le mu isomo te, &lt;&lt;Egbo egidigidi iyinayina i yi fo&gt;&gt; akwɛyi kporo inyashi i du mbo kyamate kwomba bɔkɔ kwu yi oko uwu rifo mo tayi, onzu uwu a vuluma ba e yi mo.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, lunyi ba lu yi mu ipu tee, kwɔfyi kwɔngu kwu-u du yi kporo, kyamate uwɛlɔ bɔkɔ e bo mutu tayi mo. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Lunyi lɛɛbi lu kwu enzu umba ɛbɛ mbala ɔnɔnda, lu kwu ɛmɛ umba utu mbala ipwu mo. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, kinzu la ki yi mate umbafo bɔkɔ o yi mu ondo ikpolomo awu mo. la ki yi ɛnwu nzu ma, la ki kyo ki ngbɛndu, <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />mo mutu gba enzu o kpondo le, mutu tete gba o wo atɛ gba o yi mbomo le. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Kinzu ba ki kwu enzu umba ɔnɔnda awu, la ki yi ɛnwu nzu ma. La ki ra la ikwu idu fulo nzu mbala idɛnyi nzu kyamate kwɔkpata tayi, mbala eyifulomo iyi isama nzu mbala kwokata ungwu kwoso. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ukpo a ŋa nzu te ka le lo nzu inyashi mo. A ŋa nzu ka la ki fya isama mba Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Ɔzhizɔsi e kpomo kwuwo nzu kaka ka, kwuyengwu a ba gbama awu, akwu wa mbwalu wu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo o mbala umba bɔkɔ o degbo la reyi e re mbo moshi ka la ki ŋɔ mbala wu ɔkpɔ bɔ ɔkpɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, la lu kyakpɔ mu esu ɛnwu ikama, la lu mbwala esu ma kyamate lu yi mu iwomo awu.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyemalu Imbwambwa Mbala Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Iyi Ɔpɔlu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, ishoshi te wa to keyi yi umba bɔkɔ ɔ zɔ yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo mu ɛshɔshi awu, la lu lo mbo mo. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />La lu to mbo la ɔlu kwuwongu ɛduma iyi o wo mekeka yi. La lu ŋɔ moloto mbala esu. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, ki so yi te, umba bɔkɔ akwu akyɔbwɔ mekeka yi, la lu tu mbo mo, umba bɔkɔ o wiyi, la lu kamba ɛnwu ma, umba bɔkɔ o yi ekpasu mo, ba la lu mbwamba ma. La lu yidu mbala uwewe. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ o wo wu ira, la wakusa mo. La lu wo iyeshi iyɔkpɔɔ mbala esu mbala onzu uwunawuna.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />La lu koko lu mwɔnyɛ iyɔkpɔɔ, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />la lu lɛ Ukpo kwuye ngwunangwuna, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki du yi, la lu gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi, mo apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi gba Ukpo a gyi te li wo le mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />La lu nyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ɛduma iwomo ma yi mo, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />la lu zhi ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi Ukpo ma mo, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />tetete la lu mondo iyinayina ma dɛ,, kaa la lu ra la iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyeshi. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Ira iyinayina, la lu to yi mo.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Ki lɛ Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɔkwu uwu e shi iŋɔma iyolotu awu te, la wuluyi ma sɛsɛsɛ. U wu le shi kwundu yi mbala ɛnwu yi ekpasu ka li ŋɔ sɛsɛsɛ nzhii ba ɔnuwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a ba gbama mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Edego-ala uwu bɔkɔ a ya yi ma le, e wo yimo, mo uwu akwu Ukpo uwu ɔ wɛ kwɔlɛ mawu.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, lunyi tete la lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwo nzu. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />La lu gbɛlɛ ɛmɛnɛ lɛɛbi ɛnyi, la lu kpa esu idu. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Mi gyite la lu wa kwupwu kwɔlɛ ma la ɛmɛnɛ lɛɛbi mu idomo iyi Ɔkwu. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Ki lɛ Ukpo te ka esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>